sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Learner
  participant App as Mobile/Web client
  participant API as NestJS API
  participant Cache as Redis cache
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Queue as BullMQ queue
  participant Worker as Background worker
  participant Provider as External provider

  Learner->>App: Starts a learning or review action
  App->>API: Sends authenticated request
  API->>API: Validate DTO, auth, locale, permissions
  API->>Cache: Read cached metadata when available
  Cache-->>API: Cache hit or miss
  API->>DB: Read/write product data
  DB-->>API: Persisted result
  API->>Queue: Enqueue async side effects when needed
  API-->>App: Return user-facing response
  Queue-->>Worker: Deliver job
  Worker->>DB: Update state or audit metadata
  Worker->>Provider: Send notification/email/webhook when needed
  Provider-->>Worker: Provider result
